.TH ITUTE164-PLAN-CHECK 1 "May 2026" "libitute164" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
itute164-plan-check \- validate a libitute164 E.164 numbering plan
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B itute164-plan-check
.I e164-plan.txt
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B itute164-plan-check
loads and validates a libitute164 external numbering-plan file.
.PP
The command exits with status 0 when the file is valid. It prints a diagnostic
and exits non-zero when the file cannot be loaded or contains invalid rules.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libitute164 (7)
